@startuml
title 领域模型类图 — Iteration 2（最终）
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam wrapWidth 180
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide empty members
hide circle
top to bottom direction

interface Identifiable {
  + getId(): long
}

abstract class AbstractEntity implements Identifiable {
  - id: long
  + getId(): long
  # setId(long): void
  + isNew(): boolean
  + equals(Object): boolean
  + hashCode(): int
}

abstract class Person extends AbstractEntity {
  - name: String
  - gender: Gender
  - phone: String
  + getName(): String
  + getGender(): Gender
  + getPhone(): String
  + updateProfile(String, Gender, String): void
}

class Employee extends Person {
  - username: String
  - email: String
  - passwordHash: String
  - passwordSalt: String
  - departmentId: long
  - role: Role
  - status: EmployeeStatus
  - hireDate: LocalDate
  + getUsername(): String
  + getEmail(): String
  + getDepartmentId(): long
  + getRole(): Role
  + getStatus(): EmployeeStatus
  + getHireDate(): LocalDate
  + getPasswordHash(): String
  + getPasswordSalt(): String
  + isAdmin(): boolean
  + isActive(): boolean
  + canTeach(): boolean
  + updateUsername(String): void
  + updateEmail(String): void
  + updateDepartment(long): void
  + updatePassword(String, String): void
  + changeStatus(EmployeeStatus): void
  + changeRole(Role): void
}

class Student extends Person {
  - studentNo: String
  - classId: long
  - enrollmentDate: LocalDate
  - status: StudentStatus
  + getStudentNo(): String
  + getClassId(): long
  + getEnrollmentDate(): LocalDate
  + getStatus(): StudentStatus
  + isActive(): boolean
  + transferTo(long): void
  + changeStatus(StudentStatus): void
}

class Department extends AbstractEntity {
  - name: String
  - description: String
  + getName(): String
  + getDescription(): String
  + rename(String): void
  + updateDescription(String): void
}

class Course extends AbstractEntity {
  - code: String
  - name: String
  - description: String
  + getCode(): String
  + getName(): String
  + getDescription(): String
  + update(String, String, String): void
}

class SchoolClass extends AbstractEntity {
  - code: String
  - name: String
  - headTeacherId: Long
  - startDate: LocalDate
  - endDate: LocalDate
  - capacity: int
  - status: ClassStatus
  + getCode(): String
  + getName(): String
  + getHeadTeacherId(): Long
  + getStartDate(): LocalDate
  + getEndDate(): LocalDate
  + getCapacity(): int
  + getStatus(): ClassStatus
  + isFull(int): boolean
  + canAcceptStudent(): boolean
  + isFinished(): boolean
  + changeStatus(ClassStatus): void
  + assignHeadTeacher(Long): void
  + updateDetails(String, String, LocalDate, LocalDate, int): void
}

class ClassCourse extends AbstractEntity {
  - classId: long
  - courseId: long
  - teacherId: Long
  - createdAt: LocalDateTime
  + getClassId(): long
  + getCourseId(): long
  + getTeacherId(): Long
  + getCreatedAt(): LocalDateTime
  + isAssigned(): boolean
  + assignTeacher(Long): void
  + unassignTeacher(): void
}

class Score extends AbstractEntity {
  - studentId: long
  - classCourseId: long
  - score: double
  - updatedAt: LocalDateTime
  + getStudentId(): long
  + getClassCourseId(): long
  + getScore(): double
  + getUpdatedAt(): LocalDateTime
  + isPassed(): boolean
  + updateScore(double, LocalDateTime): void
}

enum Gender {
  MALE
  FEMALE
  OTHER
  UNKNOWN
}

enum Role {
  ADMIN
  TEACHER
}

enum EmployeeStatus {
  ACTIVE
  DISABLED
}

enum ClassStatus {
  PLANNED
  ACTIVE
  FINISHED
}

enum StudentStatus {
  ACTIVE
  SUSPENDED
  GRADUATED
}

' 多重性读法：左端数字描述右侧对象可关联的左侧对象数量，右端数字反之
Department "1" -- "0..*" Employee : employs >
SchoolClass "0..*" -- "0..1" Employee : headTeacher >
ClassCourse "0..*" -- "0..1" Employee : teacher >

SchoolClass "1" *-- "0..*" ClassCourse : offers >
Course "1" -- "0..*" ClassCourse : referencedBy >
SchoolClass "1" -- "0..*" Student : currentClass >
Student "1" *-- "0..*" Score : owns >
ClassCourse "1" -- "0..*" Score : assessedBy >

Employee --> Role
Employee --> EmployeeStatus
Person --> Gender
Student --> StudentStatus
SchoolClass --> ClassStatus

note right of ClassCourse
  teacherId 为 Long 且可空，
  空表示“待分配”；
  classId / courseId 创建后不可变。
end note

note right of Score
  classCourseId 创建后不可变；
  学生转班不迁移历史成绩；
  唯一键为 (studentId, courseId)，
  courseId 由 classCourseId 解析。
end note

note bottom of Student
  Score 的唯一组合拥有者：
  删除学生时级联删除其成绩；
  FINISHED 归档保护下禁止删除。
end note

note bottom of AbstractEntity
  所有实体都提供“带 id 的构造器”，
  仅供 CSV 重建使用（D-06）；
  业务代码一律用不带 id 的构造器。
end note

note right of SchoolClass
  status: PLANNED → ACTIVE → FINISHED，
  FINISHED 为结业归档终态。
end note

@enduml
